  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"One more beer",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And I'll take you all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "All of you – ahahaha...\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Banned from all bars",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "The man with seven scars",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCCC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Smack it up, flip it, pulled out, 'bout to fail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Sunday in the ATL and I'm all outta ale",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Like a bat out of hell, tripped on a cat tail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Mutt drinkin' out a pail, \"Who let the rat out the cell?!\"",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Got all the ingredients and recipe, might as well",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Since last week, the bootlegger been in jail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "If all else fail, inhale a L",
          "rhyme": "l",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Make it so they can't see your sale via snail mail",
          "rhyme": "Ejl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Mind like a sewer, servin' rhyme on a skewer",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "DOOM'll step to a fine dime like he knew her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "\"My black sister!\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "She said \"Step back!\" before he kissed her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "She did The Dipper and the smack just missed her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "There go a list of politics like Henry Kissinger",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Ninety-nine percent of rap's just a friendly listener",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'm like, \"These dudes must have some screws loose to hate y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Or a couple of ounces short of deuce-deuce or 8 Ball\"",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Y'all know it's time for the end when the day come",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Buy a album, get rudely insulted over fake drums",
          "rhyme": "9m",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Same CDs you get for free, you break 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Wa-alaikum, make 'em eat they food like Steak-umm",
          "rhyme": "EtR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Why she wanna ask me if I could pass the paprika?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "One hand on the mic, the other on the beaker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Every week or so, peek out the lab, throw \"Eureka!\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "A technique to keep somethin' uniquer in your speaker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "For yo' information, I didn't do the beat, y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "It ain't my fault, if she didn't move her feet at all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Skeeter–robbed Peter to pay Paul",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "So he could trick it on Mary, so she could play ball",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABACCADEFGGGGGGHIJKLMNFNFHHII",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABBACBDEEEEEEFGFDBBADADFFGG"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "She better have my skrilla",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Cut it out with all that funny hand jive, will ya?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "All this trouble for a tall glass of OE",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You drink it all fast it'll make you haul ass slowly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Remind me to remember what you told me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Holy moly, did you get a load of her roly-poly?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Yo, G, remind me to remember what you told me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Whoever don't feel him, feel balls like a goalie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDCDC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCBCB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "One for the money, twofor the better green",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Three, four Methylenedioxymethamphetamine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Told a knock-kneed ghetto queen, \"Get the head fiend –",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Tell him it's from Medellin and use oxyacetylene\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Who needs airplay? It's all just hearsay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Leave a wig like it was having a bad hair day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Lyrical 'Glide Master', ask him what's his secret",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "He said, \"Shasta, it turns to formaldehyde faster\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "When I'm home with my lady, I try to duke her daily",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "One night, she tried to flail me with her ukulele (Uh-oh!)",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Pack your heat, the Villain on the cover of Black Beat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "With a bunch of crackers and some snack meat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDDDCEFGH",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDDDCAEAE"
    },
